{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/blocks_english.png?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/GIF_Steam_01.gif?t=1749126617\" /><br>Welcome to Block Factory, a serene and satisfying building experience. Design thoughtful workflows to craft adorable 3D figurines, made from simple building blocks, and bring them to life with care and attention.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/lignebf7.gif?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/2_design_english.png?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/GIF_Steam_02.gif?t=1749126617\" /><br>Design your factory as a relaxing creative space. Stack, shape, cut, paint, glue,... and assemble with care using specialized machines, each step unfolding like a quiet melody. Watch your creations evolve piece by piece as you unlock new technologies.<br>There\u2019s no rush, refine at your own pace and enjoy the process as your ideas come to life.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/lignebf7.gif?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/3_creative_english.png?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/GIF_Steam_01_3.gif?t=1749126617\" /><br>Create your own 3D figurines block by block, then build a relaxing production flow to bring them to life. Once complete, share your creations with friends and the world, creativity has no limits here.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/lignebf7.gif?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/4_what_english.png?t=1749126617\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A relaxing creative experience<br></li><li>Build and refine flowing production lines without pressure<br></li><li>Charming 3D figurines made from modular building blocks<br></li><li>Evolving miniature displays that showcase your progress<br></li><li>Flexible play modes that support every style, from light design to deep creativity</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2827680?t=1749126617","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/50ba9614829d415aed5ea17d780294d5256ee352/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749126617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/47d7cd31836e376fb46a22395f2168928f9c6e9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749126617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/47d7cd31836e376fb46a22395f2168928f9c6e9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749126617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3209880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/blocks_english.png?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/GIF_Steam_01.gif?t=1749126617\" /><br>Welcome to Block Factory, a serene and satisfying building experience. Design thoughtful workflows to craft adorable 3D figurines, made from simple building blocks, and bring them to life with care and attention.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/lignebf7.gif?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/2_design_english.png?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/GIF_Steam_02.gif?t=1749126617\" /><br>Design your factory as a relaxing creative space. Stack, shape, cut, paint, glue,... and assemble with care using specialized machines, each step unfolding like a quiet melody. Watch your creations evolve piece by piece as you unlock new technologies.<br>There\u2019s no rush, refine at your own pace and enjoy the process as your ideas come to life.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/lignebf7.gif?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/3_creative_english.png?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/GIF_Steam_01_3.gif?t=1749126617\" /><br>Create your own 3D figurines block by block, then build a relaxing production flow to bring them to life. Once complete, share your creations with friends and the world, creativity has no limits here.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/lignebf7.gif?t=1749126617\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/4_what_english.png?t=1749126617\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A relaxing creative experience<br></li><li>Build and refine flowing production lines withou